  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<p>This layer should be used together with OTN Segment.<br />&nbsp;</p><p>Access points can be spatially related to a trail network based on relative location to a trail segment. Not all trail networks will have official access points.</p><p>The OTN relies on data sharing partnerships with local trail organizations and municipal, provincial and federal governments for ongoing updates and maintenance.</p><p>Trails in the OTN must be:</p><ul><li>associated with a named trail organization</li><li>intended for free or paid public access</li><li>marked and maintained</li></ul><div><p><strong>Additional Documentation</strong></p><div><ul><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/OTN-Trail-Segment-Access-Point-User_Guide.docx' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>OTN Access Point - User Guide (Word)</a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/LIODataDoc-OTN-AccessPoint.docx' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>OTN Access Point - Dataset Documentation (Word)</a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Ontario Trail Network-Licensed Sources.docx' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Ontario Trail Network - Licensed Sources (Word)</a></li></ul></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><strong>Status</strong><br />&nbsp;</div><div>On going: Data is continually being updated<br />&nbsp;</div><div><br />&nbsp;</div><div><strong>Maintenance and Update Frequency</strong><br />&nbsp;</div><div>Irregular: data is updated in intervals that are uneven in duration<br />&nbsp;</div><div><br />&nbsp;</div><div><p><strong>Contact</strong><br />&nbsp;</p><div>Ontario Ministry of Natural Resources - Geospatial Ontario, <a href='mailto:geospatial@ontario.ca' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>geospatial@ontario.ca&nbsp;</a></div></div></div>"
